 R←Test_Compose_04(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;cp;parms;rc;msg;text;subject;from;addr
⍝ Header values with characters above ⎕UCS 127 are UTF-8 encoded words; the address itself stays as it is
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 cp←∆OfflineParms
 cp.Org←'Jäger GmbH'
 subject←(30⍴'Łódź ⍵ '),'end'
 parms←∆NewMail subject
 parms.From←'Kai Jäger <kai@aplteam.com>'
 parms.CC←'Grüße an Łukasz <lukasz@example.com>'
 (rc msg text)←cp ∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf∧/78≥≢¨∆HeaderLines text
 →T.PassesIf∧/127≥⎕UCS∊∆HeaderLines text
 →T.PassesIf'Jäger GmbH'≡∆DecodeWords text ∆Header'Organization'
 →T.PassesIf subject≡∆DecodeWords text ∆Header'Subject'
 from←text ∆Header'From'
 addr←' <kai@aplteam.com>'
 →T.PassesIf addr≡(-≢addr)↑from
 →T.PassesIf'Kai Jäger'≡∆DecodeWords(-≢addr)↓from
 →T.PassesIf'Grüße an Łukasz'≡∆DecodeWords{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'<'}text ∆Header'CC'

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
